			<item>
				<title>끄덕끄덕일기</title>
				<link>http://localhost:1313/docs/previous/2022/22blog22/</link>
				<pubDate>Mon, 10 Oct 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
				<guid>http://localhost:1313/docs/previous/2022/22blog22/</guid>
				<description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;끄덕끄덕일기&#34;&gt;&#xA;  끄덕끄덕일기&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;anchor&#34; href=&#34;#%eb%81%84%eb%8d%95%eb%81%84%eb%8d%95%ec%9d%bc%ea%b8%b0&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;#2022. 10. 10. 00:21&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;hr&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;2275&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b6ce21c9-ac4c-4d23-a362-b7555e8a498f&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이수업은 좋으면서 싫고 먼가 애매..! 들으러가는길은 자유롭고 좋은데 들을때는 너무 고통스럽고 눈앞이흐려짐 근데 마치고 집가는길에는 날아갈것같다&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이날 박태준 카페탐험기 봤는데 진짜재밌었어서 더좋았다&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;1706&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e27049ec-7d1b-42f0-9bc5-aef3547c08a3&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이날 되게알차게 뭔가를했는데 뭘했는지는 기억안나네&#xA;스벅에서 빵시켜먹으면 기분 좋음&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;1706&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/425f64cc-b635-48ae-8c1e-2acaf4a93fe6&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이날 엄마랑 민이랑 시내가서 마제소바 먹고 자라에 쇼핑도 갔다&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;960&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7bf9335f-a287-41d3-add4-e5b7cad7a8bb&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이날은 할머니 할아버지랑 브런치먹으러갔다&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;1840&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/9cfd694f-7340-41a3-87e4-3a07adea7b33&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;스켑틱을 집중잘될때에 읽으면 너무너무 행복함&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;1706&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2aa1dda3-3f22-4434-9fbf-a83b7f5bbbaa&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;기분애매할때는 편의점에서 라면이나 과자 털이&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;img width=&#34;1280&#34; height=&#34;1706&#34; alt=&#34;image&#34; src=&#34;https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/047f2432-a8e3-468e-81c5-6fb8e09cb7f0&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;이날 기분 안좋을필요 없었던데&amp;hellip; 아쉽다 안좋았던거&lt;/p&gt;</description>
			</item>
